"category":"New Mexican Cuisine","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Bars","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Lounges","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Dance Clubs","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Beer","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Wine & Spirits","historical_business_count":1}],"history":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Beer, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":7},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"ZCUygqx1Oq-08wOTF3gDqA","review_id":"dLJgH_sWD8nNoJaMAoX24Q","date":"2015-10-12T07:15:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9274630546569824,"text_excerpt":"My Friday spot. I love Handsome Willy's for dancing. I usually come after midnight for the fun. The space inside is usually packed, with some people dancing and some people hanging out. The front and back patios allow for a nice break from the crowded interior. I generally don't like crowds but I only like Handsome Willy's when there is a crowd. I have stopped over on other nights when it's much less busy and I don't like it at all. There is a kitchen in the back and it's usually tacos and burritos, but they sometimes have pop-ups."},{"business_id":"ZCUygqx1Oq-08wOTF3gDqA","review_id":"VeSb1OuSVWGApzBwg5-pLg","date":"2017-06-30T02:18:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.921463131904602,"text_excerpt":"One of my favorite bars in NOLA. Great customer service. Ask for Victoria. She NEVER disappoints. I've been coming here since I moved to NOLA and she's been my go to bartender ever since. $1.50 tacos on Thursdays. Great for Saints games Sundays and there's always an interesting face or conversation to be had. The chefs aren't bad either. They've expanded into the former Pizza building next door so you can enjoy a sit down lunch if that's your preference. Keep doing your thing Handsome Willys. You've found a customer for LIFE."},{"business_id":"ZCUygqx1Oq-08wOTF3gDqA","review_id":"2YqxHSHKJ4pRcIUUnUU_rQ","date":"2013-01-16T03:27:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9203758835792542,"text_excerpt":"Handsome Willy's has always been a go to for med students and other healthcare people. It's perfectly divey and cheap and laid back. We always hit this up after a major exam. The best part.. is now they serve lunch! Nothing fancy, but pretty delicious tacos, burritos, and quesadillas (although, y'all know I'm partial to tacos). I prefer their pulled pork.. and their burritos I've tried are pretty good and not like you're regular Mexican fare (which is hard to come by anyways in New Orleans). Try out back -- the patio is a nice place to sit and relax in the sun (or shade) after a long day. It feels like porch drinking in the middle of downtown. And you can't beat their drink specials. If y..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZCUygqx1Oq-08wOTF3gDqA","photo_id":"tW1eAT7SDnpvwqDgVInvMQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tW1eAT7SDnpvwqDgVInvMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7902730703353882},{"business_id":"ZCUygqx1Oq-08wOTF3gDqA","photo_id":"6cDzlolaFQ1HAEzeiMi_ug","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6cDzlolaFQ1HAEzeiMi_ug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7899078130722046},{"business_id":"ZCUygqx1Oq-08wOTF3gDqA","photo_id":"efQXZPprEkn2jJqhpPpyOg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/efQXZPprEkn2jJqhpPpyOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7876707315444946},{"business_id":"ZCUygqx1Oq-08wOTF3gDqA","photo_id":"kK1clV3_DweAbYxLrm1e1Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kK1clV3_DweAbYxLrm1e1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7856337428092957},{"business_id":"ZCUygqx1Oq-08wOTF3gDqA","photo_id":"tnWWrvtPtd9mFzlNES4dRg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tnWWrvtPtd9mFzlNES4dRg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7146875858306885}]},"notebook_case":null}
